# Never copy host dependencies into the image — they may be built for a
# different platform, and they make the build context enormous.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist

# Secrets must come from the runtime environment, not be baked into a layer
# that anyone who pulls the image can read.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea

*.md
!README.md

**/npm-debug.log*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
